  <p><strong>Information may be outdated.</strong> Exhibits, animals, hours, paths, and attractions change. Animal information, exhibit locations, maps, audio stories, and challenge content in the App may contain errors or be out of date. For current hours, closures, and visitor rules, check with the Zoo directly.</p>
